ent-LavalandMobBileworm = bileworm
    .desc = Bileworms are dangerous detritivores that attack with the highly acidic bile they produce from consuming detritus.
ent-LavalandMobGoldgrub = goldgrub
    .desc = A worm that grows fat from eating everything in its sight. Seems to enjoy precious metals and other shiny things, hence the name.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorRed = red raptor
    .desc = A resilient breed of raptor, battle-tested and bred to humble its foes in combat.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorWhite = white raptor
    .desc = A caring breed of raptor, always ready to help its kin.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorPurple = purple raptor
    .desc = A small, nimble breed of raptor, more of a travel companion than a mount.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorGreen = green raptor
    .desc = A tough breed of raptor, made to withstand the harshest punishment.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorYellow = yellow raptor
    .desc = This breed possesses greasy fast speed, making light work of long pilgrimages.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorBlue = blue raptor
    .desc = Covered in tough, lava resistant feathers with thick insulated fur underneath, this breed can march through lava and fire alike.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorBlack = black raptor
    .desc = An ultra rare breed. Due to its sparse nature, not much is known about this sort, but it is said to possess many of its peers abilities.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorYoungRed = red raptor youngling
    .desc = A young raptor that can grow into a robust, trusty steed. Rather naive at such an age.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorYoungWhite = white raptor youngling
    .desc = A young raptor that can grow into a robust, trusty steed. Rather naive at such an age.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorYoungPurple = purple raptor youngling
    .desc = A young raptor that can grow into a robust, trusty steed. Rather naive at such an age.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorYoungGreen = green raptor youngling
    .desc = A young raptor that can grow into a robust, trusty steed. Rather naive at such an age.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorYoungYellow = yellow raptor youngling
    .desc = A young raptor that can grow into a robust, trusty steed. Rather naive at such an age.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorYoungBlue = blue raptor youngling
    .desc = A young raptor that can grow into a robust, trusty steed. Rather naive at such an age.
ent-LavalandMobRaptorYoungBlack = black raptor youngling
    .desc = A young raptor that can grow into a robust, trusty steed. Even at this age it looks dangerous.

# Taming, saddling and riding of lavaland fauna (LavalandTamingSystem)
lavaland-tame-eats = The { $target } eats from your hand.
lavaland-tame-success = You have tamed the { $target }!
lavaland-saddle-untamed = The { $target } is not tamed yet.
lavaland-saddle-affixing = You start affixing the saddle to the { $target }...
lavaland-saddle-ready = The saddle is secure. The { $target } is ready to ride.
ent-LavalandGoliathSaddle = goliath saddle
    .desc = This rough saddle will give you a serviceable seat upon a goliath! Provided you can get one to stand still.lavaland-saddle-required = The { $target } needs a saddle first.
